{"case_id":"postage_success","category":"required","evidence_mode":"live_api_real_tools","http_status":200,"actual_tool":"query_faq","actual_arguments":{"keyword":"邮费"},"actual_tool_result":{"status":"success","data":[{"id":2,"question":"邮费是多少？","answer":"单笔实付满 99 元包邮,未满收取 10 元基础运费。\n偏远地区(新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分区域)加收 12 元附加运费,该附加运费不参与包邮,\n需单独支付。邮费即运费,按本条规则收取。偏远地区的配送时效在正常时效基础上顺延 2 至 4 天。\n港澳台及海外暂不支持配送,下单前请确认收货地址在可配送范围内。","category":"shipping"}],"code":null,"message":null,"retryable":false},"tool_status_events":[{"name":"query_faq","tool_call_id":"call_00_w0o3aAm8okdCQ0y9pxXP4700","status":"running","attempt":1},{"name":"query_faq","tool_call_id":"call_00_w0o3aAm8okdCQ0y9pxXP4700","status":"succeeded","attempt":1}],"final_answer":"您好，邮费规则如下：\n\n- 单笔实付满 99 元包邮；未满 99 元收取 10 元基础运费。\n- 偏远地区（新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分区域）加收 12 元附加运费，该附加运费不参与包邮，需单独支付。\n- 偏远地区配送时效在正常时效基础上顺延 2 至 4 天。\n- 港澳台及海外暂不支持配送，下单前请确认收货地址在可配送范围内。\n\n如需进一步了解，请随时告诉我。","expected_response_guidance":"按命中内容说明满99元包邮、未满10元基础运费、偏远地区另加12元，并保留附加运费不参与包邮的条件。","checks":{"tool_name_matches_label":true,"tool_arguments_match_label":true,"one_completed_response":true,"original_faq_keyword_preserved":true,"actual_faq_query_returned_expected_rows":true,"final_answer_uses_current_fee_policy":true,"stream_matches_persisted_answer":true,"faq_sql_replay_query_captured":true,"faq_sql_replay_keyword_matches_expected":true,"faq_sql_replay_limit_is_five":true,"faq_sql_replay_returns_expected_rows":true},"deterministic_checks_pass":true,"manual_response_review_required":true,"conversation_id":"26fc361d-9bd3-4f1a-802f-c845acb9276d","faq_sql_replay":{"source":"live replay of FAQRepository.search_literal","keyword":"邮费","row_count":1,"rows":[{"id":2,"question":"邮费是多少？","answer":"单笔实付满 99 元包邮,未满收取 10 元基础运费。\n偏远地区(新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分区域)加收 12 元附加运费,该附加运费不参与包邮,\n需单独支付。邮费即运费,按本条规则收取。偏远地区的配送时效在正常时效基础上顺延 2 至 4 天。\n港澳台及海外暂不支持配送,下单前请确认收货地址在可配送范围内。","category":"shipping"}],"query":{"statement":"SELECT faq.id, faq.question, faq.answer, faq.category \nFROM faq \nWHERE (faq.question 